@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title To add a publication genre (Main - REST)

actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
participant ":GenreRESTController" as Ctrl
participant ":GenreService" as Service

Administrator -> UI : I want to add a new genre
activate UI
UI --> Administrator : What is the genre name?
deactivate UI
Administrator -> UI : genreName("Drama")
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl : POST /genres?userId={userId}\n body: { genreName }
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Service : createAndSave(dto.genreName(), userId)
activate Service

ref over Service
[[2_BackendCanCreateGenre.puml Can Create Genre]]
end ref

ref over Service
[[3_BackendCreateGenre.puml Create and Save Genre]]
end ref

Service --> Ctrl : genre
deactivate Service

ref over Ctrl
[[4_BackendBuildResponse.puml Build Response]]
end ref

Ctrl --> UI : 201 Created\n body: GenreResponseDTO
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Administrator : Genre successfully added!
deactivate UI

@enduml